@startuml
title Candidate First-Interview Email Workflow

state "Interview Details Entered" as InterviewDetailsEntered
state "Preview Ready" as PreviewReady
state "Schedule-Only Confirmation Ready" as ScheduleOnlyReady
state "Interview Saved And Email Requested" as EmailRequested
state "Interview Saved, Manual Notification Required" as ManualNotificationRequired
state "Email Accepted For Sending" as EmailAccepted
state "Email Failed" as EmailFailed
state "Email Retry Requested" as RetryRequested
state "Preview Invalidated" as PreviewInvalidated

[*] --> InterviewDetailsEntered : FirstInterviewDetailsEntered

InterviewDetailsEntered --> PreviewReady : PreviewInterviewConfirmation\n[email and Reply-To valid]
InterviewDetailsEntered --> ScheduleOnlyReady : PreviewInterviewConfirmation\n[email or Reply-To unavailable]

PreviewReady --> InterviewDetailsEntered : EditInterviewDetails
PreviewReady --> PreviewInvalidated : CandidateOrAppointmentChanged
PreviewInvalidated --> InterviewDetailsEntered : ReloadCurrentDetails

PreviewReady --> EmailRequested : ScheduleInterviewAndRequestConfirmation
ScheduleOnlyReady --> ManualNotificationRequired : ScheduleInterviewWithoutEmail

EmailRequested --> EmailAccepted : ProviderAcceptedRequest
EmailRequested --> EmailFailed : ProviderRejectedOrFailedRequest
EmailFailed --> RetryRequested : RetryCandidateEmail
RetryRequested --> EmailAccepted : ProviderAcceptedRetry
RetryRequested --> EmailFailed : ProviderRejectedOrFailedRetry
EmailFailed --> ManualNotificationRequired : ContinueWithManualNotification

EmailAccepted --> [*]
ManualNotificationRequired --> [*]

note right of PreviewReady
Read-only fixed Jobstream template.
Candidate preference selects Dutch or English;
missing or unsupported preference defaults to Dutch.
end note

note right of EmailRequested
The interview schedule and durable email request
are persisted idempotently before provider delivery.
end note

note right of EmailFailed
The interview remains scheduled.
Retry targets only the existing email request and
cannot repeat the lifecycle transition.
end note

note bottom
Provider acceptance is not proof of candidate delivery,
receipt, opening, or reading.
TODO: Select the email provider and approve production
template copy, sender-domain controls, and failure policy.
end note

@enduml
